ia":{"extract":"The Amazon black howler (Alouatta nigerrima) is a species of howler monkey, a type of New World monkey, endemic to the south-central Amazon in Brazil. Until 2001, most authorities included it as a subspecies (or simply a taxonomically insignificant variation) of the red-handed howler, though its distinction had already been pointed out much earlier.","revisionId":1356899842,"title":"Amazon black howler","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_black_howler","wikidataId":"Q456535"}}]}
